---
title: "Editable Component"
description: "Render the editable surface and configure browser events, rendering, overlays, and DOM strategy."
---

`Editable` renders the editable document surface for the nearest `Plite` provider; app code customizes what content looks like while the runtime owns browser selection, DOM repair, void shells, and editing events. Use [Editing Behavior](../../concepts/15-editing-behavior) for the event-to-commit pipeline and [Selection And DOM](../../concepts/16-selection-and-dom) for model selection, native selection, DOM coverage, and large-document selection proof.

## Minimal usage

```tsx
<Plite editor={editor}>
  <Editable />
</Plite>
```

